        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuing My Uncle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a week at your uncle’s house in this short, choice-driven visual novel.<br>From time to time, a special <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button will appear, letting you move the story forward in unexpected ways.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approx. 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for ages 12 and up (R12)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> button cannot be skipped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the scene, the button may appear as <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Pursue / Don’t Pursue.&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The button’s options change according to the story. In moments where there’s no clear way to avoid pursuit, or when the narrative requires it, only <strong>&quot;Pursue&quot;</strong> will be shown.</p></li></ul>",
